{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_manna_app", "label": "@tiswell/manna (standalone finance app)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L1-4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Named for the daily bread provided in the wilderness \u2014 provision, one day at a time. Its own app on its own origin in the Tiswell family."}, {"id": "readme_log_screen", "label": "Log screen (landing, built for speed)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L7-10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Type an amount and hit Add; category and wallet come from whatever you used last, so the common case is two taps. Any row can be tapped afterwards to correct it."}, {"id": "readme_month_screen", "label": "Month screen (in / out / net)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L11-12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In / out / net, where the money went, and arrows back through past months."}, {"id": "readme_wallets_screen", "label": "Wallets screen (balance per wallet)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A balance per wallet and a grand total."}, {"id": "readme_integer_centavos", "label": "Amounts stored as integer centavos", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L15-17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Floats would drift a centavo at a time through the sums, and a ledger that doesn't add up is worse than none."}, {"id": "readme_transfer_kind", "label": "Transfer as a first-class kind", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L19-23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shifts both wallet balances but is excluded from month totals and the category breakdown: PHP 2,000 moved from cash to GCash is not PHP 2,000 earned and PHP 2,000 spent."}, {"id": "readme_txn_sheet", "label": "TxnSheet (edit sheet)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L76-77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The edit sheet is what makes amount-only logging safe rather than sloppy \u2014 speed on entry is only acceptable because correction afterwards is one tap."}, {"id": "readme_embedded_tile", "label": "Tiswell embedded tile and postMessage session handshake", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L25-39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tiswell does not compile Manna in; it appears as an embedded tile pointed at an origin. Embedded, Manna adopts the host's session over postMessage (@data/handshake) so there is no second sign-in; opened standalone it shows its own sign-in and reaches the same data."}, {"id": "readme_shared_instantdb", "label": "Shared InstantDB app as storage", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L34-50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Storage is a shared InstantDB app rather than per-origin browser storage, so a transaction logged in Manna and a capture jotted in Tiswell live in the same place and both sync to every device. VITE_INSTANT_APP_ID being the identical string in both repos is literally what makes them one database; VITE_TISWELL_ORIGIN allowlists which origins a session is accepted from."}, {"id": "readme_source_aliases", "label": "Shared design system via source aliases", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L51-58, L89", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Borrows Tiswell's tokens, UI components and TiswellData layer as source via vite aliases pointing at ../TisWell/src, so the app always looks unmistakably Tiswell. Cost: both folders must sit side by side even to build. resolve.dedupe keeps react and @instantdb/react to a single copy each."}, {"id": "readme_seeded_fixed_ids", "label": "First-run seeding with fixed ids", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L78-81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default categories and a Cash wallet are seeded with fixed ids so two devices seeding before they sync upsert the same rows instead of leaving duplicates."}, {"id": "readme_namespace_convention", "label": "finances namespace prefix convention", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L78-79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data sits in the shared database under finances, finances:categories and finances:wallets \u2014 a prefix convention rather than distinct tables."}, {"id": "src_money_monthsummary", "label": "monthSummary", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L22-23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_money_walletbalances", "label": "walletBalances", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L22-23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_manna_app", "target": "readme_log_screen", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L7-10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_manna_app", "target": "readme_month_screen", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "